---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
const base = import.meta.env.BASE_URL.replace(/\/?$/, "/"); // "/profitprint/"
---
<Base title="Privacy Policy — PrintProfit" description="What data PrintProfit does and doesn't collect.">
  <h1>Privacy policy</h1>
  <p class="meta">Last updated 2026-08-18</p>

  <p>PrintProfit is built to respect your privacy. In plain terms:</p>
  <ul>
    <li><strong>The calculator runs entirely in your browser.</strong> The numbers you type are never sent to us or anyone else.</li>
    <li><strong>Analytics:</strong> we use Cloudflare Web Analytics, which is privacy-first and does <em>not</em> use cookies or fingerprinting, and does not track you across sites. It tells us aggregate page views, nothing that identifies you.</li>
    <li><strong>No accounts, no newsletter sign-up required, no selling of data.</strong> We don't collect names or emails on this site.</li>
  </ul>

  <h2>Affiliate links &amp; third parties</h2>
  <p>When you click an affiliate link (e.g. to Amazon), that third party may set its own cookies under its own privacy policy. If we add display ads (e.g. Google AdSense) in the future, this policy will be updated to describe them before they go live, including how to opt out of personalized ads.</p>

  <h2>Contact</h2>
  <p>Questions about privacy? Reach us via the <a href={`${base}about/`}>About</a> page.</p>
</Base>
